# Ground-truth type tests extracted from open-source Sybase ASE drivers.
#
# These test cases document REAL Sybase behavior as observed by production
# drivers, not polecat guesses. They exercise integer boundaries, unsigned
# types, float precision, decimal/numeric, and string types.
